<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-09T06:56:58.233Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 06:56:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have maintained a month-long siege of Taiz while Yemeni government troops have seized the al-Jawf mountain range, intensifying front-line fighting. In Riyadh, Houthi rockets damaged the Saudi Aramco tower in the financial district and the Saudi-led coalition intercepted a Houthi cruise missile, a long-range anti-tank guided missile and downed a ballistic missile aimed at Medina. A Saudi strike near Sanaa killed 22 civilians, mostly women and children, and a Houthi-claimed airstrike near the capital killed 22 people. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/07/world/middleeast/more-than-50-killed-in-yemen.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168730&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5VWXVuNjJEM3hfaS13WXVRc05fa3NmSG5fMXNYdEpsZUdtZ0FaTVV4a1dDMmh4akU3WUNTdENNeXBZLXpyMUpGaER5ZHRqRjFzRzN1QUdWSF8zVGsxUHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOLUpUaXJBZU5CYXNqcDJjZkEtUlc5MWZRcVlsWmFWaWhDcHRJMTNLM05iV25SMEtHTGZyTTZHN3NlaGlGY1dwUFUxQmxXcFNxdmt5R3J1MVJGbmdjblFVMmR0UldtU2M3b0htSGE0YmNBSnNpd1JtVnJHTWlMMnRycHdYUFR1WGN5ck1rdjM0ZmtjNEstR1ZjZjh5X1d2M3g4RUY0bXVoR1VOOUNuWllTVm9qVzJuQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE1ic25uWHlYZnZkOHpIT1BncTlGZ0oyZDdCU2IzZ3dqXzR1T0dyVzdVdnhjTk5oT0FoS29GSVg0bkRfMDQxOU5BbnRSZVRONFZEbmY2WDFpSW5OX3R5QmNCY29fZ29ZaDFRU2VTbUVlNzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPSUtxYmp1UFN6dHhjdnM2X24xYm05OVFCNWJGSWJ4V2t6bm80VDhVQXpmWnZ5TzE4Mk1FTHdBSnVFTlUxN3ZzVFF3cTUzYUNuMGVYYkwwbENfMmpXdy1